If \code{sense = "max"}:
\deqn{
\sum_{i \in \mathcal{I}} a_i w_i \le A
}

If \code{sense = "equal"} and \code{tolerance = 0}:
\deqn{
\sum_{i \in \mathcal{I}} a_i w_i = A
}

If \code{sense = "equal"} and \code{tolerance > 0}, the equality is stored as
